Let's say you have an entity class called `User` with attributes `id`, `username`, and `age`.

```java
@Entity
public class User {
    @Id
    @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)
    private Long id;

    private String username;

    private int age;

    // getters and setters
}
```

You also have a repository interface for `User`:

```java
