### Step 1: Create Individual Resolver Functions

Create separate functions for each resolver. This not only makes the code more readable but also allows you to test each resolver individually if needed.

### Step 2: Update the Resolvers File

Here's how you can refactor your `resolvers.ts`:

```typescript
// src/graphql/resolvers.ts

